\begindata{text,37325278720}
\textdsversion{12}
Gas meters in Massachusetts are required to be updated every seven years. 
When you receive a notice, please \htmlatk-link{schedule an appointment}. 
It's quick, free, and helps ensure your service continues without 
interruption.\
\enddata{text,37325278720}

